// Clue Name :
"P100083351" "Cimerora Lore"
// DetailString :
"P2518646152" "Cimerora is an ancient land in the Mediterranean. Many believe it is the birthplace of the super powered being. Montague notes that this is not altogether accurate. Cimerora is, however, one of the more famous locations in history where various origins of power came together in a similar way that is happening in our current timeline.<br><br>Montague also notes that Imperious, the man you're supposed to contact, comes from an origin that has been completely absent for some time. That of the <color orange>Incarnate</color>."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3563860947" "Have you ever heard of <color deepskyblue>Cimerora</color>, {HeroName}?  Ever since Ouroboros started altering the timeline, I became aware of a gift I had. I can perceive the changes in a timeline, yet I am unaffected by it. This has made me aware of some other alterations throughout time. I need you to meet someone. His name is <color deepskyblue>Imperious</color>.<br><br>He is not of this time or place, but I feel his need, and the need of his people, transcends both of those."
// AcceptString :
"P46093837" "Talk to Imperious"
// SendOffString :
"P4294891887" "To get to Cimerora, we're going to, er, 'bypass' Ouroboros. I'd prefer them not to be involved in this particular mission.<br><br>I've procured an <color orange>Aspect of the Pillar</color> myself. This crystal has been attuned to take you to Cimerora and nowhere else. I've kept the crystal hidden within the Midnighter Club."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2539155413" "Travel to Cimerora"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3670189704" ""You need to go into the Midnighter Club, enter the secret room and travel to Cimerora through the aspect of the crystal. Once you're there, you must meet up with Imperious. He will guide you on what to do from there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3608005212" "Here's a dossier on Cimerora. This should hopefully get you up to speed on this ancient land."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3289329198" "Well met, traveler. I have met with your ally, Montague Castanella. He is a strange, but determined man. When he first arrived here, I thought he was one of Romulus' men, disguised in some eccentric garb. It wasn't until I questioned him that I learned he was, in fact, here to help. I believed little of what he said, even in these amazing times. Before I sent him home, I told him that if he truly wanted to aid my people, he must send champions to aid me.<br><br>Looking on you now, I believe he may have done just that."

